Problem: I've been trying to make sense of this: i keep putting off studying even though finals are close. I end up scrolling until midnight, feel guilty, and then sleep badly. I want to study consistently without panicking every night. That's what keeps standing out to me.
Relevant domains/subdomains: {"Behavioral": ["Routine", "Technology usage", "Productivity"], "Physical": ["Sleep"], "Psychological": ["Stress"]}

