"How do you think your sleep patterns might be impacting your ability to stay focused and motivated during job application periods?", 
"Are there any particular situations or emotions that make you more likely to avoid job applications altogether?", 
"What would happen if you were able to maintain a consistent routine of applying for jobs, even on days when it's not ideal?", 
"Can you think of any specific events or experiences from your past that might be influencing your current behavior around job applications?"]
