    "Can you think of any specific situations where you've been able to study consistently without feeling overwhelmed?",
    "Are there certain times of the day or week when you find yourself more or less motivated to study?",
    "Do you have any habits or routines that help you transition from one activity to another, like studying to scrolling?",
    "Can you recall a time when you felt like you were getting into a productive study routine, and what made it work?",
